@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275

### Healthy check
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health/

### OpenApi
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Perform valuation of policy
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000001/valuation

### Get policy
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000001
